   "body": "Follow-up: the reported request asked for a nested routing group, not the local model directly. The group contains both unmasked and masked providers and uses a remote classifier. The current code deliberately masks when any possible group member needs it; classifier text is masked separately. Both are potential contributors to `masking_ms`, so I cannot yet attribute the 2.005 s to either one without further instrumentation.\n\nA safe fix needs to keep the original and masked bodies separate through retries and mask before any attempt to a provider that requires it; the remote classifier must remain protected. I have not yet produced or verified a patch.\n",
   "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
   "pin": null,
